§ `Act 25 of 2021, section 84: section 61(1) (in operation 1 April 2022)`

-- src:BA1994.20120831:2031 | Equipment of licensee not subject to distress, etc.
-- src:BA1994.20120831:2032 | 61.—(1) No equipment or related facility of a licensee used for
-- src:BA1994.20120831:2033 | providing, transmitting or delivering licensable broadcasting services
-- src:BA1994.20120831:2034 | shall be subject to distress or be liable to be taken in execution under
-- src:BA1994.20120831:2035 | any process of a court in any bankruptcy or insolvency proceedings by
-- src:BA1994.20120831:2036 | any person without the prior approval of the Minister in writing.
@ref s 61(1), Revised Edition 2012 (src:BA1994.20120831:2031-2036)
