§ `S 738/2024: the Fourth Schedule replaced (in operation 25 September 2024)`

-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 24 September 2024 at 5 pm.
@ref S 738/2024, first publication (src:BA1994-S738-2024:3)
`S 738/2024 was first published on` MEANS Date 24 9 2024

-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:19 | 1. This Order is the Broadcasting Act 1994 (Amendment of
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:20 | Fourth Schedule) Order 2024 and comes into operation on
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:21 | 25 September 2024.
@ref S 738/2024 para 1 (comes into operation on 25 September 2024) (src:BA1994-S738-2024:19-21)
-- The Order states its own day, so this is the Order's, not an inference from the annotation "wef 25/09/2024" in the consolidation.
`S 738/2024 takes effect on` MEANS Date 25 9 2024

-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1399 | New Fourth Schedule
-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1400 | 8. The Broadcasting Act 1994 is amended by inserting,
-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1401 | immediately after the Third Schedule, the following Schedule: 10
-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1403 | “FOURTH SCHEDULE
-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1407 | ONLINE COMMUNICATION SERVICES
-- src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1408 | 1. Social media service.”. 15
@ref Fourth Schedule as inserted by Act 38 of 2022 s 8 (src:BA1994-ACT38-2022:1399-1408)
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:23 | Replacement of Fourth Schedule
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:24 | 2. In the Broadcasting Act 1994, replace the Fourth Schedule
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:25 | with —
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:26 | “FOURTH SCHEDULE
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:27 | Sections 2A(1), 2B(1), 2C and 2D(1)
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:28 | and (4)
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:31 | PART 1
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:32 | ONLINE COMMUNICATION SERVICES
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:33 | 1. Social media service.
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:34 | 2. App distribution service.
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:37 | PART 2
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:38 | DEFINITIONS
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:39 | 1. In this Schedule —
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:40 | “app” means an application software package that includes content
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:41 | accessible by end‑users, or allows end‑users to access content on the
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:42 | Internet through the installed application software;
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:43 | “app distribution service” means an electronic service (that is accessible
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:44 | by Singapore end‑users) that is provided for the purpose of enabling
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:45 | end‑users to download an app where the download of the app is by
-- src:BA1994-S738-2024:46 | means of access to the Internet.”.
@ref Fourth Schedule as replaced by S 738/2024 para 2 (src:BA1994-S738-2024:23-46)
`the Fourth Schedule as inserted by Act 38 of 2022` MEANS
    `Provision text version` WITH `source` IS "the Fourth Schedule as inserted by Act 38 of 2022 s 8: item 1, social media service"
                                , `takes effect on` IS `Act 38 of 2022 takes effect on`
                                , `published on` IS `S 29/2023 was first published on`
                                , `is the text after the amendment` IS FALSE

`the Fourth Schedule as replaced by S 738/2024` MEANS
    `Provision text version` WITH `source` IS "the Fourth Schedule as replaced by S 738/2024: Part 1 items 1, social media service, and 2, app distribution service, and Part 2 definitions of app and app distribution service"
                                , `takes effect on` IS `S 738/2024 takes effect on`
                                , `published on` IS `S 738/2024 was first published on`
                                , `is the text after the amendment` IS TRUE

`the Fourth Schedule versions` MEANS LIST `the Fourth Schedule as inserted by Act 38 of 2022`, `the Fourth Schedule as replaced by S 738/2024`

GIVEN conduct IS A DATE
      reading IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the Fourth Schedule lists, for conduct on a day, the law read as at a day` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision text version read` `the Fourth Schedule versions` conduct reading
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST v THEN IF v's `is the text after the amendment` THEN JUST "a social media service and an app distribution service" ELSE JUST "a social media service"

